{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The black sheep of the family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are a lot of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw them out ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D-Single player occasional game in a colorful comic style you are steering a tank, slaloming around white sheep and throwing out the black sheep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, don't throw out white sheep. This gives minus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the difficulty level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As higher it is, so more sheep are moving around and the become more and mor faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 2 meadows, now: Start and Neuschwanstein.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the videos are complete games.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2680870?t=1766163752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766163752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680870/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766163752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680870/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766163752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>New: Neuschwanstein meadow</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We added a new meadow:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neuschwanstein</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The black sheep of the family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are a lot of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw them out ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D-Single player occasional game in a colorful comic style you are steering a tank, slaloming around white sheep and throwing out the black sheep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, don't throw out white sheep. This gives minus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the difficulty level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As higher it is, so more sheep are moving around and the become more and mor faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 2 meadows, now: Start and Neuschwanstein.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the videos are complete games.</p>","developers":["Rumisoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680870/header.jpg?t=1766163752","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) 2023 Rumisoft","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2680870/998979275/dffb897cb6571675d057517d55725699973296fc/1766159890/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766163751","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2680870/998979275/dffb897cb6571675d057517d55725699973296fc/1766159890/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766163751","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2680870/998979275/dffb897cb6571675d057517d55725699973296fc/1766159890/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766163751","id":257252851,"name":"Trailer-Neuschwanstein","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257252851/085c282a24b99ef387e2d43919f2769e482aad52/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766163751"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2680870/631570/b8846d95fcc53bb0c27d8c7ae256a81bfaec0b03/1750942609/dash_av1.mpd?t=1701940051","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2680870/631570/b8846d95fcc53bb0c27d8c7ae256a81bfaec0b03/1750942609/dash_h264.mpd?t=1701940051","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"h